<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian bourse closed Tuesday for holdiay.</title>
<headline>Nigerian bourse closed Tuesday for holdiay.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Nigerian stock exchange did not trade on Tuesday because of the public holiday for the 36th anniversary of independence from Britain.</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
